        <h2>Festa della Repubblica 2025</h2>
        <p class="project-meta">Kuala Lumpur | April - July 2025</p>
        <p class="lead">Italian National Day celebrations at the Embassy of Italy in Kuala Lumpur.</p>

        <a class="video-container project-video-loop project-video-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hz1xPkvdhcI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-video-loop-card data-video-id="hz1xPkvdhcI" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="15" data-fade-ms="650" aria-label="Open Italian National Day 2025 video on YouTube in a new tab">
