        <p class="lead">Celebrating the 78th Anniversary of the Italian Republic.</p>

        <a class="video-container project-video-loop project-video-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T7MQqKLdZvc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-video-loop-card data-video-id="T7MQqKLdZvc" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="15" data-fade-ms="650" aria-label="Open Italian National Day 2024 video on YouTube in a new tab">
