        <div>
            <p>Held on May 30th at the Mandarin Oriental, the 78th Anniversary of the Italian Republic was a grand showcase of "Made in Italy," hosting over 1000 guests and featuring prestigious brands like Boggi Milano and Maserati. I personally assisted His Excellency Massimo Rustico in organising and managing the structure and logistics of this major event. My contributions were pivotal in managing collaborations to promote Italian culture, including creating ad-hoc video content for the Italian National Anthem. I also provided extensive support in preparing diplomatic meetings and managing guest protocols, ensuring the event adhered to the highest standards of diplomatic conduct.</p>
        </div>
