            <p>Celebrated on March 7th at the Ambassador's Residence, the 8th edition of Italian Design Day focused on the theme "Manufacturing Value," showcasing the intersection of traditional craftsmanship and modern technological innovation through iconic brands like Ferrari and FOPE. I supported the organisation of this exclusive event in collaboration with the Italian Trade Agency (ITA) and local partners, ensuring the successful promotion of Italian design heritage. My role involved assisting with logistical coordination at the residence to facilitate a prestigious showcase that engaged local design communities and stakeholders.</p>

