        <p class="lead">Giornata Nazionale dello Spazio: The Italian Spaceway.</p>

        <div>
             <p>Hosted by Ambassador Massimo Rustico, this event launched the exhibition "The Italian Spaceway: Towards IAC Milan 2024," bringing together key figures like the Director-General of the Malaysian Space Agency (MYSA) to foster potential collaborations between Italy and Malaysia. I was actively involved in the organisation of these initiatives, coordinating with the Embassy and Malaysian stakeholders. I helped facilitate the event's logistics and flow, ensuring that the focus remained on highlighting Italian contributions to aerospace and fostering international technological cooperation.</p>
